    <string name="live_privacy">Your screen and sound go straight to the platform you chose. Rekordo has no server and keeps nothing.</string>
    <string name="live_help_youtube">YouTube: open YouTube Studio › Create › Go live › Stream. Copy the « Stream key » here. The server is already filled in. Your channel must be enabled for live streaming (first time: up to 24 h).</string>
